  "title": "Easy 4-Ingredient Pasta Bake",
  "description": "Easy to make with just 4 ingredients, this delicious cavatappi pasta bake with tomatoes, bacon, and Velveeta® cheese is a great choice for a last-minute dinner.",
  "authors": [
    "Susan Falcone Daquino"
  ],
  "date_published": "2016-08-27T22:49:27-04:00",
